ual races to stay inspired \n•Connect with a worldwide fitness community \n•Share your progress and celebrate achievements \n \nREWARDS THAT KEEP YOU MOVING \n•Earn rewards through activity and engagement \n•Get exclusive adidas experiences and products \n•Stay connected to the wider digital world of adidas  \n \nBUILT FOR EVERYONE \n•Download and get started in just a few clicks \n•Supports all types of activities and fitness goals \n•Designed to help you build habits that last ",
